	<field name="a"                               offset="0x0.16"   size="0x0.1" access="RO" descr="Activity. Set for new entries. Set if a packet lookup has hit on the\;specific entry, only if the entry is a route. To clear the a bit, use\;“clear activity” op.Enabled by activity_dis in RGCR, see\;section 17.8.1 - MPGCR - MPLS General Configuration Register" />
